<title>USA: Geoscience to sell software business.</title>
<headline>Geoscience to sell software business.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>GeoScience Corp on Tuesday said it plans to sell the geoscientific software business of its CogniSeis Development Inc unit to Paradigm Geophysical Ltd for cash and guaranteed future royalties value at between $19.5 million and $23 million.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to recognize an after-tax gain of about $5 million after royalties, payment of certain retained liabilities and expenses of the sale.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to be closed within 45 days, the company said.</p>
